{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-7-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_7_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_1:b1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"7.1 筛选期\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_1:b2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"筛选期从试验参与者签署知情同意书开始，至完成入排标准确认后、随机化前结束；用于资格评估、基线评估和背景治疗稳定性确认。所有筛选评估日期和结果均应记录。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_1:b3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"基线评估应包括记录稳定背景鼻用激素使用情况；完成双侧鼻息肉评分（NPS）、鼻塞VAS（0～10 cm）、SNOT-22和Lund-Kennedy内镜评分；并完成入排标准确认和随机分层所需信息。基线评估应与研究流程表（SoA）一致。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_7_1:b4\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"筛选评估异常时，可在随机化前重复相关评估以确认资格；重复评估的日期、结果和最终入排判断均应记录。不得通过重复评估规避入排标准或修改随机分层因素。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"4cafcaa681cbff15b9d85aba4667bc4460dfb722c2dff5507005c586dec4afd7"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:c011eb89a419e187e9ad1d4afaf3aeb08d28230c6789b9248bb0c155043bd731:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:c011eb89a419e187e9ad1d4afaf3aeb08d28230c6789b9248bb0c155043bd731:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"4a2bf2a03d83686d7db9d00e20f29b3189cb79e47b630de44a1c4318179ceda8","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"30eb30ba-5624-4f4b-bf7e-f40899ab7163","requested_reaso